  "fixes": [
    "Business-plan named table reservations with guest count, optional contact, arrival time and notes",
    "Cashiers can create, edit, seat and cancel reservations with server-enforced Business access",
    "Concurrent booking protection, lost-response retries and stale seat/cancel protection",
    "Reserved tables are protected from generic layout changes; no bill or stock movement before seating",
    "Seating preserves the guest snapshot on the dining bill and order",
    "Existing reservations can be honored or cancelled after a paid plan downgrade; new and edited reservations remain Business-only",
    "Business pricing lists named reservations; existing independent subscriptions, themes, sessions and native companion launch preserved"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "No physical printer paper output, live merchant settlement, provider email/message delivery or Play submission was performed",
    "Screen profiles run on an isolated AOSP Android 14 emulator, not physical Xiaomi or Samsung firmware",
    "Legacy sales without saved costs are reported as unknown rather than recalculated from current product costs",
    "Old inventory history may lack movements recorded before this release; new movements are written atomically",
    "Offline recipe sales reconcile using the recipe at synchronization and flag shortages for staff review",
    "Reservations hold one table immediately until seating or cancellation; future time-slot scheduling, automatic expiry and customer notifications are not included"
  ],
